      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Ah, the word 'escrow' is like a magical spell in the world of real estate, isn't it? An escrow agent is like a wise and trustworthy goblin who holds onto your treasure (money) until the deal is sealed. They ensure that both you and the seller are playing fair, like a referee in a goblin game of tug-of-war. This way, neither party can just snatch your gold and run off with it before the deal is truly done. The escrow agent makes sure that the seller has the keys to the house and that you have the keys to your new home, all before the final goblin handshake is given. It's all about trust and keeping the peace in the goblin community!",
